# Toy handoff ledger for the known-good control tree. The claims step REQUIRES this file and pins
# its id set to the five ids the project's own records use (H7-1, H7-2, H8-3, D10, D11), so the
# good tree carries one well-formed row per id: a good tree without a ledger would fail the step,
# which is the point of the requirement (EV-05). Phase 16 added H16-1, H16-2 and H16-3 to the
# project's id set, so this tree carries their three rows too.
